{"id":1598,"title":{"romaji":"Kotonoha no Niwa","english":"The Garden of Words","native":"言の葉の庭"},"slug":"kotonoha_no_niwa","synopsis":"Some people revel and play in the rain; others dread it and hide at the first drop. For high school student Takao, a summer shower is a source of artistic inspiration… but when he skips school in order to sketch in a rainy garden, Takao finds an even greater muse in Yukino, an older woman who seems adrift in the world. Despite the difference in their ages and lives, they strike up a comfortable relationship that slowly evolves as they randomly meet in the same garden whenever it rains. But with the rainy season coming to a close, Takao wonders if there's enough time left to put his feelings into actions and words.\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","format":"MOVIE","season":"SPRING","year":2013,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:07","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 04:28:26","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":16782},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":16782},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":7515},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":9589},{"site":"ANN","externalId":14995},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":5329},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":70291121}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":3187,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/iAj5Nl7VCY5GrE7YHkrgwKnoZoxCjnGxJmrJeMAL.png"},{"id":3188,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/EXGwtaQQuUTygYsrmGRuafTJCnlteN8sqAmWET15.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":122,"name":"CoMix Wave Films","slug":"comix_wave_films"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":5235,"slug":"ED1","type":"ED","sequence":null,"song":{"id":5235,"title":{"romaji":"Rain","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":5988,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":true,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":4683,"basename":"KotonohaNoNiwa-ED1.webm","filename":"KotonohaNoNiwa-ED1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/KotonohaNoNiwa-ED1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":88320108,"resolution":1080,"nc":f